(2625, 'Breakfast', 'Smoothies', 'Kiwi fruit smoothie', 'This simple kiwi, mango and pineapple fruit smoothie makes an ideal morning treat. It\'s an easy way to pack in the vitamins and give yourself a boost', 'Green smoothie recipes', 5, 0, 'Easy', '3 peeled kiwi fruit, 1 mango, peeled, stoned and chopped, 500ml pineapple juice, 1 banana, sliced', 'Put all of the ingredients in a blender and blitz until smooth then pour into 2 tall glasses.', 2, '35g', '36g', '1g', '0.1g', '2g', '3g', '163', '0.04g', 5, '[\"Breakfast\",\"Smoothies\",\"Green smoothie recipes\"]', '', NULL),
(2626, 'Breakfast', 'Smoothies', 'Raspberry and apple smoothie', 'Whip up a breakfast smoothie with raspberries, apples, yogurt and oats. It\'s a great way to start the day and up your fruit intake', 'Breakfast smoothies', 5, 0, 'Easy', '2 apples, cored (we used Granny Smith) , 150g frozen raspberries, 150ml natural yogurt, 2 tbsp porridge oats, Â½ lemon, juiced , 100ml milk', 'Tip all ingredients into a blender or smoothie maker and blitz until smooth, adding 50ml water or milk if itâ€™s too thick.', 4, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 5, '[\"Breakfast\",\"Smoothies\",\"Breakfast smoothies\"]', '', NULL),
(2627, 'Breakfast', 'Smoothies', 'Breakfast smoothie', 'Make the most of the berry season with a glass of fruity goodness', 'Breakfast smoothies', 5, 0, 'Easy', '1 small ripe banana, about 140g blackberries, blueberries, raspberries or strawberries  (or use a mix), plus extra to serve, apple juice  or mineral water, optional, runny honey, to serve', 'Slice the banana into your blender or food processor and add the berries of your choice. Whizz until smooth. With the blades whirring, pour in juice or water to make the consistency you like. Toss a few extra fruits on top, drizzle with honey and serve.', 1, '24g', '25g', '1g', '0.1g', '2g', '5g', '124', '0.01g', 5, '[\"Breakfast\",\"Smoothies\",\"Breakfast smoothies\"]', '', NULL),
